# Copy to .env for Sepolia deployment. NEVER commit .env (it is gitignored).
# Leave these empty for localhost-only development.
#
# SEPOLIA_RPC_URL: HTTPS endpoint for the Sepolia testnet (chain ID 11155111),
#   e.g. from Alchemy or Infura. Paste the full https:// URL here.
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=
# PRIVATE_KEY: 0x-prefixed private key of a DEDICATED Sepolia test wallet.
#   Must hold only Sepolia test ETH, never real assets. Never share it,
#   never put it in frontend .env files (VITE_* vars ship in browser JS).
PRIVATE_KEY=
